node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
**/build
# Next.js dev-server cache — grows unbounded while `next dev` runs (observed
# apps/landing+members+backoffice's .next/dev/cache/turbopack/* alone adding
# several GB), and Dockerfile.API/Dockerfile.Workers' pruner stage discards
# it anyway (turbo prune only keeps what the target app actually needs). Not
# excluding this means every build transfers gigabytes of irrelevant cache to
# the daemon before pruning ever gets a chance to drop it.
**/.next
**/.turbo

# Secrets must never enter the build context — Dockerfile.API/Dockerfile.Workers
# both `COPY . .`, so anything matched here would otherwise be baked into the
# image layers. Runtime config comes from the platform's injected env
# (loadEnvFiles uses override:false, so process.env always wins anyway).
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
